#: ../../language/error_codes/E0098.md:1
msgid "E0098"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0098.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `cancellable_defer`"
msgstr "警告名称：`cancellable_defer`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0098.md:5
msgid ""
"A `defer` or `errdefer` expression contains cancellable asynchronous "
"code. If cancellation triggers the cleanup, its asynchronous operations "
"can be cancelled immediately as well, preventing the cleanup from "
"completing."
msgstr "`defer` 或 `errdefer` 表达式包含可取消的异步代码。如果清理由取消触发，其中的异步操作也可能立即被取消，导致清理无法完成。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0098.md:9
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0098.md:11
msgid "The examples use the experimental standard-library async runtime:"
msgstr "这些示例使用实验性的标准库异步运行时："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0098.md:13
msgid ""
"import {\n"
"  \"moonbitlang/core/async\",\n"
"}\n"
"options(\"allow-experimental-packages\": true)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0098.md:17
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub async fn operation() -> Unit {\n"
"  defer @async.sleep(1)\n"
"  @async.sleep(1)\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0098.md:21
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0098.md:23
msgid ""
"Protect required asynchronous cleanup from cancellation. With "
"`moonbitlang/core/async`, wrap it in `@async.protect_from_cancel`:"
msgstr "应保护必要的异步清理，避免其被取消。使用 `moonbitlang/core/async` 时，将清理代码包装在 `@async.protect_from_cancel` 中："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0098.md:26
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub async fn operation() -> Unit {\n"
"  defer @async.protect_from_cancel(() => @async.sleep(1))\n"
"  @async.sleep(1)\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0098.md:30
msgid ""
"Synchronous cleanup does not need this wrapper. Keep protected cleanup "
"bounded so that cancellation does not wait indefinitely for it to finish."
msgstr "同步清理不需要此包装。受保护的清理应能在有限时间内完成，避免取消操作无限等待。"
